@startuml
autonumber

title Mid-CBF Provisioning Process

actor "Maintainer" as M
participant "Netbox\n(Source of Truth)" as NB
participant "Bifrost / Ansible\n(Orchestrator)" as BIF
participant "DiskimageBuilder" as DIB
participant "HTTP Server" as HTTP
participant "Ironic Services\n(DHCP/PXE)" as PXE
participant "Target FHS Server" as FHS

== 1. Inventory Creation ==
note right of M: **INPUT** HW BOM.
M -> NB: Update hardware/config data
M -> BIF: Manually trigger inventory sync
BIF -> NB: Fetch data
BIF -> BIF: Generate mid-cbf-inventory.yml

== 2. Building an Image ==
M -> DIB: Manually initiate build command
note right of DIB: Uses YAML & Block Device configs
DIB -> DIB: Build tb_jammy_...qcow2
M -> DIB: Access built image
M -> HTTP: Move/Upload .qcow2 to web root
note right of HTTP: Image available at\nhttp://<IP>:8080/

== 3. Enrolling the Server ==
M -> BIF: Run enroll-dynamic.yaml
BIF -> PXE: Register node details (Redfish/MAC)

== 4. Image Deployment ==
M -> BIF: Run deploy-dynamic.yaml
BIF -> PXE: Signal deployment start
PXE -> FHS: Instruction via Redfish (Reboot to PXE)
FHS -> PXE: PXE Boot (DHCP + Ramdisk)
activate FHS
FHS -> FHS: Clean hard drives
FHS -> HTTP: Download .qcow2 image
FHS -> FHS: Write image to disk & Reboot
FHS -> FHS: cloud-init starts\n(Setup IP & User access)
deactivate FHS

== 5. FHS Configuration (Ansible) ==
BIF -> FHS: Execute Ansible Roles
activate FHS
BIF -> FHS: Configure Network, Drivers, packages
BIF -> FHS: Install Monitoring (Prometheus)
BIF -> FHS: Install BIST
BIF -> FHS: InstallK8s
== 6. Joining K8s Cluster ==
BIF -> FHS: Cluster Join
FHS -> FHS: Node Ready
deactivate FHS
BIF --> M: Provisioning Successful
== OUTPUT: Deployment Inventory File ==
M -> NB: Export inventory
M <- NB: Roles + IP.
note right of M: **OUTPUT** List of roles and IP ready for deployment.
@enduml
